 "content": "<amp-story standalone=\"\" title=\"Balance : tout savoir sur ce signe\" publisher=\"Aurenstar\" publisher-logo-src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/logo-96.png\" poster-portrait-src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/poster-sign-libra.webp\"><amp-story-page id=\"cover\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/cover-libra.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:48.634%;width:88.350%;height:38.251%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:51.913%;width:76.699%;height:10.383%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:4.372vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Balance : tout savoir sur ce signe</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:63.388%;width:76.699%;height:16.393%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.322vh;font-weight:400;color:#647DA5;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Découvrez les secrets de la Balance, signe d’air gouverné par Vénus. Forces, défis, amour et travail : apprenez-en plus sur ce signe raffiné et sociable.</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:81.694%;width:76.699%;height:3.005%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.913vh;font-weight:700;color:#E73578;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Touchez pour continuer →</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p1\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-air.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:40.710%;width:88.350%;height:46.175%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:44.262%;width:45.631%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:45.082%;width:45.631%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Le saviez-vous ?</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:50.546%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Les bases de la Balance</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:61.202%;width:76.699%;height:22.131%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">La Balance règne autour du 23 septembre au 22 octobre. Signe d’air, de qualité cardinale, gouverné par Vénus : charme, harmonie et nouveauté sont au rendez-vous.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p2\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-air.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:44.399%;width:88.350%;height:42.486%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:47.951%;width:28.641%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:48.770%;width:28.641%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Son atout</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:54.235%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">L’art de la diplomatie</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:64.891%;width:76.699%;height:18.443%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">La Balance excelle pour créer la paix et rapprocher les gens. Elle sait écouter et trouver le bon compromis avec élégance.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p3\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:48.087%;width:88.350%;height:38.798%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:51.639%;width:35.922%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:52.459%;width:35.922%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Attention à…</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:57.923%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Difficulté à trancher</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:68.579%;width:76.699%;height:14.754%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Cherchant souvent l’équilibre, la Balance peut avoir du mal à prendre une décision ferme ou à exprimer un désaccord.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p4\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-air.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:48.087%;width:88.350%;height:38.798%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:51.639%;width:26.214%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:52.459%;width:26.214%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">En amour</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:57.923%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Recherche d’harmonie</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:68.579%;width:76.699%;height:14.754%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">En couple, la Balance aime la complicité et la beauté du lien. Elle cherche à bâtir une relation équilibrée et douce.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"p5\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%;top:3.552%;width:32.039%;height:6.557%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:7.767%;top:4.235%;width:26.214%;height:4.918%;\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/logo-aurenstar.webp\" width=\"540\" height=\"180\" layout=\"fill\" object-fit=\"cover\" object-position=\"50% 10%\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:5.825%;top:44.399%;width:88.350%;height:42.486%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:47.951%;width:31.068%;height:4.098%;background-color:#E73578;border-radius:15px\"></div><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:48.770%;width:31.068%;height:2.732%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1.639vh;font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;line-height:1.25;margin:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase\">Au travail</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:54.235%;width:76.699%;height:9.290%;font-family:Montserrat,sans-serif;font-size:3.825vh;font-weight:800;color:#3982C8;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">Travail d’équipe apprécié</p><p style=\"position:absolute;left:11.650%;top:64.891%;width:76.699%;height:18.443%;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:2.459vh;font-weight:400;color:#172B4D;line-height:1.25;margin:0\">La Balance brille dans les métiers où coopération et esthétique comptent. Elle favorise un climat agréable et juste au bureau.</p></div></amp-story-grid-layer></amp-story-page><amp-story-page id=\"end\"><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><amp-img src=\"https://aurenstar.com/stories/img/bg-night.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"1280\" layout=\"responsive\" alt=\"\"></amp-img></amp-story-grid-layer><amp-story-grid-layer template=\"fill\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:100%\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:4.854%